=== SUMMARY (real, proven) ===
READINESS failure: pod stayed Running (0/1), RestartCount stayed 0, removed from Service endpoints (traffic stopped, container kept running).
LIVENESS failure: pod's container was actually killed and recreated by kubelet, RestartCount incremented 0->1, confirmed via 'Killing...will be restarted' event + real restartCount field change.
This is the experimentally-proven distinction: READINESS = should this pod receive traffic (Service-level), LIVENESS = should this container be restarted (kubelet-level).
